ename":"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia","pk":"3845889966761916826","__isXIGPolarisMedia":"XIGPolarisCarouselMedia","accessibility_caption":"Photo by \ud835\udc6b\ud835\udc81\ud835\udc80 Network on March 04, 2026.","caption":{"text":"Happy Birthday to Blacc Sam \ud83c\udfc1\ud83d\udc51\n\nWishing Blacc Sam continued strength, prosperity, and success as he keeps building for the culture and the community.\n\n\ud83c\udfc1 The Marathon Continues.\n\nFollow \u0040dzynetwork for real cultural milestones, legacy stories, and powerful community moments.\n\n#BlaccSam #TheMarathonContinues #NipseyHussle #DZYNetwork"},"code":"DVfWIxiFTma","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/646072785_18097822351944417_2972549825438437019_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0FST1VTRUxfSVRFTS5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=GHHCnMuq7RkQ7kNvwEx6xkK&_nc_oc=AdqWmKACL0knVB4cgFYDph2azVpE1_Jul7HoJ-fVNrlnDjHimIUZrRWKd5oOneyk9cA&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=hnYSl2qHhflhWzjqo-bwKw&_nc_ss=7e689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQTFCjPBG6DdK-OZ4vLBVizfiStM1mWOYQScd0sJCIgT-A&oe=6B001132","media_type":8,"product_type":"carousel_container","user":{"pk":"28364400416","username":"dzynetwork","id":"17841428332485550"},"carousel_media_count":4,"id":"POLARIS_3845889966761916826"}},{"node":{"__typename":"XIGPolarisImageMedia","pk":"3845467087762996630","__isXIGPolarisMedia":"XIGPolarisImageMedia","accessibility_caption":"Photo by Blacc Sam \ud83d\udda4 on March 04, 2026.","caption":{"text":"Happy Birthday To Blacc Sam Tha Truth \ud83d\udda4 TMC \ud83c\udfc1 Bday Love \ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffe\ud83e\udd73\ud83c\udf7e\ud83c\udf8a\n#blaccsam#nipseyhussle#brotherskeeper#hussleandmotivate#themarathoncontinues \ud83c\udfc1"},"code":"DVd1_Exkb2W","seo_canonical_url":null,"display_uri":"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com\/v\/t51.82787-15\/643585245_18100182755486575_1068928946310551632_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=MhOgq1GFm0UQ7kNvwF_F3jE&_nc_oc=AdpfL2nzU_TQLO0GkiRheoyqceSpEE6TwkZlGYgfnNkbP12AYQL1-nyYW7ZMByZMnq4&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=hnYSl2qHhflhWzjqo-bwKw&_nc_ss=7e689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&oh=00_AQQWAkn-c_T5kUe5NZx8DUbCJfie7vHtTLHl5lRDG0Unkw&oe=6B00058A","media_type":1,"product_type":"feed","user":{"pk":"44475310574","username":"blaccseezy","id":"17841444597229413"},"id":"POLARIS_3845467087762996630"}},{"node":{"__typename":"XIGPolarisVideoMedia","pk":"3844086722829263279","__isXIGPolarisMedia":"XIGPolarisVideoMedia","accessibility_caption":"Video by Priince \u201cPRIIZZY\u201d Bass  \u271d\ufe0f #ThePRIIZZYShow on March 02, 2026.","caption":{"text":"\ud83c\udfc1 In the spirit of Nipsey Hussle, we remember that The Marathon Continues not just as words, but as a way of walking by faith, running with purpose, and building with vision.\n\n\u201cLet us run with perseverance the race marked out for us\u201d (Hebrews 12:1).\n\nThis new Marathon Burger in Long Beach stands as more than a business, it\u2019s a testament to endurance, ownership, and divine alignment. A reminder that when you run your race, not comparing lanes, not rushing the process, God orders your steps and crowns your consistency.\nMay this place be filled with favor, overflow, and opportunity. May it feed more than appetites, may it nourish dreams, spark conversations, and empower the community to keep striving, building, and believing.\nThe Marathon continues. The race is yours. And with God leading, every mile is blessed. Priince \u201cPRIIZZY\u201d Bass \ud83c\udfc1\u2728\n\n\u201cThe blessing of the Lord, it maketh rich, and He addeth no sorrow with it\u201d (Proverbs 10:22).\n\n#MarathonBurger #NipseyHussle #LongBeach #ThePRIIZZYShow"},"code":"DVY8IHwCKGv","seo_canonical_url":